GCC 14 __builtin_clzg / __builtin_ctzg (type-generic, optional zero-value
argument).  Non-vacuous: the last assertion is deliberately wrong and must
FAIL.  Verified against g++ 16.0.1.  Before the fix: CONVERSION ERROR.
